    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e643483e11de3ff4d85defdb6bbe7629, type: 3}
    _line: I've gotta head home, though. I wanted to make dinner tonight, and it's
      getting a little late. So hey, see you at class tomorrow!
